<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00121/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶洗面奶，瓶身上写着：“让你的皮肤光洁无暇！”使用其内容物涂抹于人体表面后，涂抹过的区域将会有类似玻璃的性质，内容物似乎是无限的，瓶盖无法被拧开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> ███市一普通市民家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低危异常物品收容柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>至少上面的标语没写错，不是吗？——Dr.pigeon</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00121" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00121" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00121-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606962546" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587966405 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">27 Apr 2020 05:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张有沙发字样的A4纸，任何视线与其接触的智人会认为该项目是沙发，通过监控摄像头观看无效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的休息室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">还在Site-CN-10的休息室内</span>被愤怒的Dr. Su撕毁，残骸被确认无异常性质。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>愚人节快乐——Dr. S73ven L1u<br />
████，S73ven你搞的让我一屁股坐地上了！——愤怒的Dr. L███████<br />
Dr. S73ven L1u 已受到惩罚——站点主管████</p>
